set -eu
# Overlap is not coverage. The host slept for all but two minutes of this two-hour gap, and the two
# minutes are one continuous awake stretch of exactly two intervals — the same threshold the gap is
# reported at — so it is not explained and the message goes out. One notifier call, not zero.
#
# Two intervals exactly is the boundary and it is deliberately on this side of it: a stretch that
# long is a stretch a tick could have run in, and 118 minutes of sleep around it does not make the
# missing tick less missing. `host-window` measures the other side, one second under.
"$BATON" tick
echo
"$BATON" status
